        }
      },
      {
        "text": "**Set them walking.** In the **Code** tab, use **sprite [them] begins [patrolling left and right on blocks]**.",
        "after": {
          "worldSprites": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "**Now your choice.** Add **when [ ] touches [ ]** and pick your player and your new character from the dropdowns. Then decide what happens: a **say** block for a friendly hello, or **restart scene** to send your player back to the start. Press **Play** and go and meet them.",
        "after": {
